  <title>Understanding Risk &amp; Returns — Agri-Fi</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f6f8;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;">
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f4f6f8;padding:24px 0;">
    <tr><td align="center">
      <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;padding:32px;">
        <tr><td style="font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#166534;padding-bottom:16px;">Agri-Fi</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;padding-bottom:12px;">{{userName}}, let's talk risk &amp; returns 📊</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="font-size:14px;line-height:22px;">
          <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">We believe in full transparency. Here's an honest picture of how Agri-Fi investments work.</p>

          <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-weight:bold;">How returns are generated</p>
          <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">When a trade deal completes, the buyer pays for the shipment. That payment flows through Stellar escrow and is distributed proportionally to all token holders based on the deal's agreed return rate.</p>

          <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-weight:bold;">Platform fee</p>
          <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Agri-Fi charges a 2% platform fee on each deal payout. The remaining 98% is split: 80% to the farmer/trader and 18% distributed to investors as returns.</p>

          <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-weight:bold;">Risks to be aware of</p>
          <ul style="margin:0 0 16px 0;padding-left:20px;">
            <li style="margin-bottom:6px;"><strong>Commodity price risk</strong> — market prices can fall between deal creation and delivery</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom:6px;"><strong>Logistics risk</strong> — shipment delays or losses can affect timelines</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom:6px;"><strong>Counterparty risk</strong> — all traders are KYC-verified but defaults remain possible</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom:6px;"><strong>Liquidity</strong> — tokens may be listed on our secondary market but liquidity is not guaranteed</li>
          </ul>

          <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-weight:bold;">How we protect you</p>
          <ul style="margin:0 0 16px 0;padding-left:20px;">
            <li style="margin-bottom:6px;">All funds locked in non-custodial Stellar escrow until delivery is confirmed</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom:6px;">Documents (certificates, bills of lading) verified and anchored on-chain</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom:6px;">Shipment milestones tracked in real-time on the blockchain</li>
          </ul>

          <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;background:#f9fafb;padding:12px;border-radius:4px;">
            <strong>Investment disclaimer:</strong> Investing involves risk. Past performance is not indicative of future results. Do not invest more than you can afford to lose. Agri-Fi does not provide financial advice.
          </p>

          <p style="margin:20px 0;">
            <a href="{{appUrl}}/marketplace" style="display:inline-block;background:#16a34a;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:6px;font-weight:bold;">View Current Deals</a>
          </p>
        </td></tr>
